  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO HUMAN REPRODUCTION PROGRAMME 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WHO SRHR allocation to a new programme , the Human Reproduction Programme seeks to extend sexual and reproductive health and rights to future generations through science and evidence. &#xa0;It supports and coordinates research on matters relating to SRHR on a global scale, builds research capacity in low-income countries, and informs and provides training on treatment protocols and regimes.&#xa0;Noting the importance of high quality science-based data and evidence in the realm of health, and especially in regard to contested aspects of sexual and reproductive health</narrative>
  </description>
